<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:07.370 --> 00:14.070
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:14.640 --> 00:20.410
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:20.650 --> 00:25.920
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:26.420 --> 00:32.520
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:32.630 --> 00:38.500
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:38.600 --> 00:41.570
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:41.670 --> 00:44.640
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:53.780 --> 00:56.950
<b>We've arrived in Akihabara nyo!</b>

00:58.220 --> 01:01.190
<b>Now what should I do first
to become a mega idol nyo?</b>

01:01.290 --> 01:04.590
<b>I can hear it nyo, I can hear it nyo.
The fans calling my name nyo...</b>

01:04.690 --> 01:06.680
<b>Dejiko-sama!
This is wonderful nyo!</b>

01:06.800 --> 01:08.190
<b>We don't have time for that gema.</b>

01:08.300 --> 01:11.270
Sign : Welcome to Akihabara

01:08.300 --> 01:11.270
<b>We first have to find
a place to stay gema.</b>

01:11.370 --> 01:11.990
<b>Nyu.</b>

01:12.100 --> 01:14.570
<b>What a hassle nyo.
We can just live in the spaceship nyo.</b>

01:14.670 --> 01:17.640
<b>No gema. It's conspicuous gema.
We have to put this away gema.</b>

01:20.010 --> 01:22.940
<b>We need to find a place that suits
someone noble like me nyo!</b>

01:23.040 --> 01:23.670
<b>Nyu.</b>

01:23.880 --> 01:26.140
<b>Akihabara Apartment Guide
Look what I found nyo.</b>

01:26.920 --> 01:29.410
<b>Why is housing so expensive nyo?</b>

01:29.520 --> 01:32.680
<b>Our first day here and
we're already homeless gema.</b>

01:32.790 --> 01:34.250
<b>What do we do nyo?</b>

01:34.360 --> 01:36.790
<b>Is something the matter here?</b>

01:37.160 --> 01:38.150
<b>Help us nyo.</b>

01:38.260 --> 01:39.390
<b>No gema.</b>

01:41.500 --> 01:44.400
Sign : Manager

01:41.500 --> 01:44.400
<b>I see. It must be hard.</b>

01:44.500 --> 01:45.970
<b>Nyo.</b>

01:46.530 --> 01:47.500
<b>I know!</b>

01:47.600 --> 01:50.900
<b>There's a room upstairs we're not using.
Why don't you live there?</b>

01:51.010 --> 01:53.240
<b>But we don't have money nyo.</b>

01:54.310 --> 01:57.970
<b>Don't worry about it.
I can't take money for that room.</b>

01:59.280 --> 02:00.940
<b>Really nyo?
Be my guest.</b>

02:01.050 --> 02:03.280
<b>Yeah nyo! What luck nyo!</b>

02:03.380 --> 02:06.150
<b>But we can't live there for free gema.</b>

02:06.250 --> 02:09.950
<b>Now that you say it,
I guess you can't live there for free.</b>

02:10.060 --> 02:12.690
<b>Look what you did nyo!
Mishter Manager's changed his mind nyo!</b>

02:12.790 --> 02:13.950
<b>Idiot, you big bloated ball!</b>

02:14.060 --> 02:16.030
<b>And thanks to you,
we lost Puchiko nyo!</b>

02:17.000 --> 02:18.020
<b>Nyu.</b>

02:18.130 --> 02:20.260
<b>What? Where did you come from?</b>

02:20.370 --> 02:22.530
<b>What are you doing?
Wow, that's amazing.</b>

02:22.640 --> 02:24.940
<b>Nyu!
Bravo! Wonderful!</b>

02:25.040 --> 02:28.030
<b>Puchiko, you can't wander off
on your own nyo!</b>

02:28.140 --> 02:31.340
<b>I guess we're going to
end up on the streets nyo.</b>

02:31.450 --> 02:35.880
<b>Some goody-two-shoes round thing
said something un-called for...</b>

02:35.980 --> 02:37.450
<b>and as a result,</b>

02:37.550 --> 02:42.050
<b>two young helpless girls will
wander the cold city streets nyo.</b>

02:42.160 --> 02:44.060
<b>A wonderful something nyu.</b>

02:44.160 --> 02:47.060
<b>Oh, that's sad, that's so sad!</b>

02:47.900 --> 02:51.090
<b>Well then,
I guess it's time to go nyo.</b>

02:51.200 --> 02:53.290
<b>Thank you for the bread nyo.</b>

02:53.400 --> 02:55.030
<b>A wonderful something nyu...</b>

02:55.140 --> 02:56.000
<b>Please wait!</b>

02:56.100 --> 02:56.570
<b>Nyo?</b>

02:56.670 --> 03:00.070
<b>How about if you girls
both help me with my store?</b>

03:00.180 --> 03:03.080
<b>In return, you can use
the room upstairs for free.</b>

03:05.810 --> 03:07.800
<b>Thank you, Mishter Manager!</b>

03:09.820 --> 03:11.650
<b>Something
Don't worry about it.</b>

03:11.950 --> 03:14.820
<b>Thank goodness gema.</b>

03:14.920 --> 03:16.720
<b>I'm Di Gi Charat.</b>

03:17.090 --> 03:19.820
<b>Nice to meet you nyo.
Call me Dejiko nyo.</b>

03:19.930 --> 03:21.830
<b>Petit Charat.</b>

03:21.930 --> 03:23.330
<b>Puchiko nyu.</b>

03:23.430 --> 03:26.090
<b>Gema gema.
Nice to meet you gema.</b>

03:26.700 --> 03:30.100
<b>"Dejiko-chan" and "Puchiko-chan," eh?</b>

03:30.210 --> 03:33.830
<b>Okay, I'm going to come everyday now.
I'm going to tell my friends too.</b>

03:35.940 --> 03:37.780
<b>Who's there nyo!?</b>

03:39.450 --> 03:41.420
<b>To be continued</b>

03:41.520 --> 03:44.820
<b>What!? The best is yet to come!</b>

